<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<!--CHROME:HEAD:START-->
<!-- SPORAFIND PWA HEAD — single source of truth.
     Managed by scripts/build-chrome.js. Push reads its VAPID key from
     GET /api/push/vapid-key at subscribe time (503 until configured). -->
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#080D1A">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Sporafind">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
<script src="/js/pwa.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/pwa-ui.js" defer></script>
<!--CHROME:HEAD:END-->
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<script src="/js/session.js"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@3.19.0/dist/tabler-icons.min.css">
<title>Sporafind — Data Room</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tokens.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/components.css">
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap');
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:var(--s0);color:var(--t1);padding:0;line-height:1.5}
a{color:var(--gl);text-decoration:none}
.section{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px}
h1{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-1px}
h1 span{color:var(--gold)}
h2{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin:32px 0 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
h2 i{color:var(--gold)}
h2:first-child{margin-top:0}
h3{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--t1)}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a0a2e,#1a1a3a);padding:48px 24px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--blue)}
.hero .subtitle{color:var(--t2);font-size:14px;max-width:640px;margin:8px auto 0}
.card{background:var(--s1);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:10px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:16px}
.card p{font-size:13px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:8px}
.card p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.card ul{list-style:none;padding:0}
.card ul li{font-size:12px;color:var(--t2);padding:6px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--s2)}
.card ul li:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.card ul li i{color:var(--gl);font-size:14px;min-width:18px}
.grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-bottom:16px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;margin:12px 0}
th{text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;color:var(--tm);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.5px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bd)}
td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--s2);color:var(--t2)}
td.num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;text-align:right;color:var(--t1)}
td.gold{color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}
.highlight-row td{background:rgba(0,168,90,0.06)}
.tag{font-size:9px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;display:inline-block;margin-left:6px;vertical-align:middle}
.tag-green{background:#0a2e1a;color:var(--gl);border:1px solid #1a4f2a}
.tag-blue{background:#0a1a3e;color:var(--blue);border:1px solid #1a2a5e}
.tag-amber{background:#2e1a0a;color:var(--gold);border:1px solid #4f2a1a}
.files-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:12px 0}
.file-item{background:var(--s2);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;text-align:center;transition:all .15s;cursor:default}
.file-item:hover{border-color:var(--bds);background:var(--s3)}
.file-item i{font-size:28px;color:var(--gl);display:block;margin-bottom:6px}
.file-item .fi-name{font-size:11px;color:var(--t1);font-weight:500}
.file-item .fi-desc{font-size:9px;color:var(--tm);margin-top:4px}
.bottom-nav{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:40px;padding:24px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--bd)}
.page-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--t2);padding:8px 14px;background:var(--s1);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:8px;transition:all .15s;text-decoration:none}
.page-link:hover{background:var(--s2);color:var(--t1);border-color:var(--bds);text-decoration:none}
.page-link i{color:var(--gl)}
@media(max-width:640px){
  .grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  h1{font-size:22px}
  .section{padding:32px 16px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hero">
  <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(37,99,235,0.15);color:var(--blue);border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.3)">&#9889; Investor Data Room</span>
  <h1 style="margin-top:12px">Sporafind <span>Data Room</span></h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Cap table, market sizing, competitive landscape, team, and legal documentation for the $50-150K pre-seed round.</p>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <h2><i class="ti ti-users"></i> Team</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:12px">
      <div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gl),var(--teal));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:white;flex-shrink:0">GB</div>
      <div><h3 style="margin:0;font-size:16px">Gabriel Ochie</h3><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--t2)">Solo Founder & Full-Stack Engineer</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--tm);margin-top:4px">Ex-developer, product builder. Built Sporafind solo — full-stack (FastAPI, Express, React, PostgreSQL), devops (Vercel, Supabase, Docker), and product. 35 tests, CI/CD, production deployment.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2><i class="ti ti-building-bank"></i> Cap Table</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p style="font-size:11px;color:var(--tm);margin-bottom:12px">Founder-friendly structure. No previous dilution. All figures in USD.</p>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Shareholder</th><th class="num">Shares</th><th class="num">%</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
      <tr class="highlight-row"><td>Gabriel Ochie (Founder)</td><td class="num">9,000,000</td><td class="num gold">90%</td><td>Common stock, 4-year vesting, 1-year cliff</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Employee Option Pool</td><td class="num">1,000,000</td><td class="num">10%</td><td>Unallocated — for future hires</td></tr>
      <tr style="border-top:2px solid var(--gl);font-weight:700"><td>Total</td><td class="num">10,000,000</td><td class="num">100%</td><td></td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2><i class="ti ti-chart-bar"></i> Market Sizing</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <table>
      <tr><th>Market</th><th class="num">TAM</th><th class="num">SAM</th><th class="num">SOM</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Ghanaian diaspora remittance intelligence</td><td class="num">$15B</td><td class="num">$500M</td><td class="num">$5M</td></tr>
      <tr><td>African diaspora intelligence (pan-African)</td><td class="num">$100B</td><td class="num">$5B</td><td class="num">$50M</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Diaspora investment platforms</td><td class="num">$50B</td><td class="num">$2B</td><td class="num">$20M</td></tr>
    </table>
    <p style="font-size:10px;color:var(--tm);margin-top:8px">TAM = Total Addressable Market · SAM = Serviceable Addressable Market · SOM = Serviceable Obtainable Market</p>
  </div>

  <h2><i class="ti ti-layout-grid"></i> Competitive Landscape</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <table>
      <tr><th>Company</th><th>Focus</th><th>Pricing</th><th>Diaspora-native</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
      <tr class="highlight-row"><td class="gold">Sporafind</td><td>Diaspora intelligence DB</td><td>$0/$29/$99</td><td style="color:var(--gl)">&#10003;</td><td>Phase A live. Claim+verify in B.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>LinkedIn Sales Nav</td><td>General B2B prospecting</td><td>$99+/mo</td><td>&#10007;</td><td>Not diaspora-specific. No segment enrichment.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Crunchbase Pro</td><td>Company & startup data</td><td>$99/mo</td><td>&#10007;</td><td>Company-focused. No individual diaspora profiles.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>PitchBook</td><td>VC/PE deal data</td><td>$3K+/yr</td><td>&#10007;</td><td>Enterprise pricing. No diaspora filter.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Apollo.io</td><td>B2B contact data</td><td>$49/mo</td><td>&#10007;</td><td>General sales tool. No diaspora targeting.</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2><i class="ti ti-gavel"></i> Legal & IP</h2>
  <div class="grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Company</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><i class="ti ti-circle-check"></i> Registered as sole proprietorship (UK)</li>
        <li><i class="ti ti-circle-check"></i> Sporafind trademark pending</li>
        <li><i class="ti ti-circle-check"></i> sporafind.com domain (owned)</li>
        <li><i class="ti ti-circle-check"></i> api.sporafind.com subdomain</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Data & Privacy</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><i class="ti ti-circle-check"></i> GDPR-compliant (UK/EU users)</li>
        <li><i class="ti ti-circle-check"></i> Public records exemption (Companies House data)</li>
        <li><i class="ti ti-circle-check"></i> Claim + verify opt-in for diaspora profiles</li>
        <li><i class="ti ti-circle-check"></i> No PII shared without consent</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2><i class="ti ti-file-text"></i> Available Documents</h2>
  <div class="files-grid">
    <div class="file-item"><i class="ti ti-presentation"></i><div class="fi-name">Pitch Deck</div><div class="fi-desc">10 slides · Web view</div></div>
    <div class="file-item"><i class="ti ti-chart-line"></i><div class="fi-name">Financial Model</div><div class="fi-desc">3-year projections</div></div>
    <div class="file-item"><i class="ti ti-dashboard"></i><div class="fi-name">Metrics Dashboard</div><div class="fi-desc">Live platform data</div></div>
    <div class="file-item"><i class="ti ti-map"></i><div class="fi-name">Product Roadmap</div><div class="fi-desc">4 phases (A-D)</div></div>
    <div class="file-item"><i class="ti ti-coin"></i><div class="fi-name">Fundraising Strategy</div><div class="fi-desc">32 targets, 8 scripts</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-nav">
    <a href="/investors" class="page-link"><i class="ti ti-home"></i> Overview</a>
    <a href="/investors/metrics" class="page-link"><i class="ti ti-dashboard"></i> Metrics</a>
    <a href="/investors/financials" class="page-link"><i class="ti ti-chart-line"></i> Financials</a>
    <a href="/investors/deck" class="page-link"><i class="ti ti-presentation"></i> Deck</a>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
